          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, ū SEEBA akūgatinginya pye a mabbaala kwandīja kū mongo gwa Fulati kūshisha kū mongo gwa Misili; hūna a bing'we Baisilaeli mūkūkobiwa ūmò ūmò mubilingwe pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, īkung'ang'aajiwa nhaaninga; hūna abo baalī baajimīīlīla mu sī ya Ashulu, na a babo baalī baponyiwa mu sī ya Misili bakwiza ī Yelusalemu kūnamya ū SEEBA, ū mu lūgūlū lwela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
